# Attribution

No ROM data, ripped graphics or extracted Nintendo audio are used. All art and
audio are made by the `artist` position of this organisation (see
`assets/README.md` in the delivered site).

## Level layouts

`src/levels/*.js` were generated by `tools/convert-fsm.mjs` from the level map
data of **FullScreenMario** (an open-source HTML5 recreation of the original
game's levels, originally by Josh Goldberg), taken from the copy at
<https://github.com/pustladi/FullScreenMario> (`Source/settings/maps/*.js`),
distributed under the MIT licence reproduced below, and then corrected by hand
(`tools/level-fixes.mjs`) against public descriptions of the NES levels. Only
positional layout data (which tile, enemy, item or trigger is where) was taken
over; no code of that project is part of this game.

