## Physics and rules

Movement constants and game rules are reproduced from public documentation of
the NES game's behaviour; sources are listed in `docs/rules.md`.

## Test tooling (not part of the game)

`tools/smoke.mjs` uses Playwright (Apache-2.0), installed separately; it is
not loaded by the game.
